# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# StepSync — Environment Variables
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# ⚠️  COPY THIS FILE TO .env AND FILL IN REAL VALUES
# ⚠️  NEVER COMMIT .env TO VERSION CONTROL
#
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Database ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# PostgreSQL connection string
# Required: Yes
# Production: Use a managed PostgreSQL provider (Neon, Supabase, RDS, etc.)
# Format: postgresql://user:password@host:5432/database?sslmode=require
DATABASE_URL=

# ─── NextAuth ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Base URL of your application (no trailing slash)
# Required: Yes
# Production: https://your-domain.com
NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Secret for signing JWT tokens
# Required: Yes
# Production: Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# ⚠️ MUST be at least 32 characters
# ⚠️ Changing this invalidates all existing sessions
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=

# ─── OpenAI ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# API key for AI study plan recommendations
# Required: Only if AI features are used
# Production: Set as environment variable on your hosting platform
# ⚠️ NEVER prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# ─── Email (Future) ───────────────────────────────────────
# These will be needed when email delivery is implemented.
# DO NOT add them now unless you have an email provider configured.
# EMAIL_SERVER=
# EMAIL_FROM=
# EMAIL_API_KEY=